                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Happy Pong is Arkanoid except if the blocks were weird heads and floated down from the top to the bottom of the screen endlessly. Despite what you may think of it from first appearances, this game is not only surprisingly fun but its really well produced! There's a lot of love and effort put into this game and it's constnatly giving me flashbacks to the PS1 Net Yaroze days. The graphics may not be much but the game makes up for that in its fun frenetic gameplay, sound design, and of course, the visual effects. Do keep in mind that too many of said effects will pretty much render the game completely unplayable though. \n\nOh and one last thing, Don't try pressing F12 to screenshot the game if you've got a nice high score going during an in-progress game. So far every time I've done that, it's broken the game and forced me to Alt+F4 it.",
